        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any product candidates that we successfully develop and commercialize will compete with current therapies and new therapies that may become available in the future.",
        "start_character": 50030,
        "end_character": 50194
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As regulatory frameworks, industry standards, and AI technologies continue to evolve, we will continue to monitor developments in AI to assess potential business opportunities as well as associated risks.",
        "start_character": 145599,
        "end_character": 145803
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because of the extensive time required for clinical development and regulatory review of a therapeutic product we may develop, it is possible that, before any of our products can be commercialized, any related patent may expire or remain in force for only a short period following commercialization, thereby reducing any advantage of any such patent.",
        "start_character": 64974,
        "end_character": 65324
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, similar to our Phase 3 study, our final commercial rilparencel product is planned to be a cryopreserved formulation, which we expect will reduce manufacturing costs compared to our prior fresh rilparencel formulation.",
        "start_character": 55445,
        "end_character": 55671
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to regulations in the United States, we are subject to a variety of regulations in other jurisdictions governing, among other things, research and development, clinical trials, testing, manufacturing, safety, efficacy, labeling, packaging, storage, record keeping, distribution, reporting, advertising and other promotional practices involving biological products as well as authorization and approval of our products.",
        "start_character": 127263,
        "end_character": 127693
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, any such changes could impact our ability to develop an adequate marketing strategy and pursue our growth strategy effectively, or even prevent us from providing our products in jurisdictions in which we receive marketing authorization, or potentially cause us to incur liability in an effort to comply, which, in turn, could adversely affect our business, financial condition, results of operations and prospects.",
        "start_character": 143232,
        "end_character": 143659
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Most of the health care providers in the United States with whom we collaborate to develop and test our products must comply with HIPAA and applicable state law.",
        "start_character": 141243,
        "end_character": 141404
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors also may obtain FDA or other regulatory approval for their products more rapidly than we may obtain approval for ours, which could result in our competitors establishing a strong market position before we are able to enter the market or make our development more complicated.",
        "start_character": 52518,
        "end_character": 52809
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are leveraging our cell therapy technology to develop product candidates designed to stop or delay kidney failure in CKD.",
        "start_character": 8813,
        "end_character": 8937
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continually assess and refine our intellectual property strategy as we develop new technologies and product candidates.",
        "start_character": 57495,
        "end_character": 57617
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed a cryopreserved version of rilparencel that allows for long-term product preservation and that is being used in our Phase 3 trial of rilparencel (called PROACT 1 or REGEN-006), and was used in our Phase 2 trial of rilparencel (called REGEN-007).",
        "start_character": 9204,
        "end_character": 9467
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-113881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-113881-7878878065fe1549",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-113881",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We may also in-license from, collaborate with, or acquire third parties to develop product candidates that we, based on our understanding of kidney diseases and pathways, believe are promising therapeutics.",
